# Quality

## Commands

Configure executable feedback commands in `.agent/harness.json`.

```bash
python3 scripts/agent_validate.py --list
python3 scripts/agent_validate.py
python3 scripts/agent_runlog.py tail --limit 10
```

Workflow policy:

```bash
python3 scripts/agent_check.py
python3 scripts/agent_spec.py doctor
python3 scripts/agent_validate.py --list
```

